Hi all,

I wanted to let you know that our latest paper:

Title  : "The Linux/ia64 Project: Kernel Design and Status Update"
Authors: Stephane Eranian and David Mosberger

is now available for downloads from the HPLabs library at:

 http://www.hpl.hp.com/techreports/2000/HPL-2000-85.html.

This paper is also part of the (online) proceedings of the 
2000 Ottawa Linux Symposium (OLS) and the corresponding presentation 
should appear very soon on their web site at:

 http://www.ottawalinuxsymposium.org/.

